   failure-branch labels "was outweighed" (x 488.0-585.6) and "did not follow through"
   (x 467.8-600.0) on the same baseline band y 139-153: 97.6x14 box overlap with 281
   shared ink pixels (light) and 270 (dark). Precise boxes, pixel counts and 4x crops:
